    "Name": "Mosquito",
    "Details": "The Mosquito MOS-NCX is a Narc missile beacon testbed, carrying a pod launcher with six charges to mark targets. An LRM 20 with two tons of ammunition follows up on marked foes, backed by a single medium laser for close defense. It relies on hit and run tactics to close and retreat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>",
